1. "Create Payment Link" — lime green circular icon with a link/chain icon.
2. "Request Money" — lime green circular icon with a wallet/card icon.
3. "QR Code" — pale mint circular icon with an upload/transfer icon.

Note: there's a large empty gap between the header and "Choose Method" in 
the reference — this appears to be an artifact of the design export (a 
faded "QR Code" label is visible bleeding through at the very top, outside 
the card bounds) rather than intentional blank space. Use a sensible, 
consistent vertical rhythm here matching the spacing patterns already used 
in ZENO Card and Send Money, rather than reproducing the large empty gap 
literally — flag this to me if you want to confirm before adjusting.

Color consistency (must reuse existing tokens, no new hex values):
- The App Shell background reuses the existing `colors.zenoSky` value 
  already configured in `wallet-screens.ts` for the GETPAID room.
- The Hero Block (dark background) uses ZENO's existing dark tones from 
  `theme/colors.ts` (`colors.zenoDark` / `colors.zenoIntro`), consistent 
  with the "Send / Get Paid → Black/dark hero" color family from AGENTS.md.
- The three option icons (lime green for Create Payment Link and Request 
  Money, pale mint for QR Code) map to existing brand tokens — reuse them, 
  flag if a shade is missing.

Animation contract (must be respected — same as ZENO Card and Send Money):
- This layout is authored at full-screen size — never build a "compact" 
  intermediate version.
- Content is anchored top-left; the island scales this surface up from its 
  own top-left corner.
- Only the top ~80px (the "Get Paid" header) needs to stay legible 
  throughout the morph — everything below is revealed/clipped naturally.

Behavior:
- Tapping "✕" or swiping up closes this room and returns to Wallet Home.
- "Create Payment Link" navigates to: Amount → Description → Expiration → 
  Review → Create → Payment Link Details (zeno.com/pay/xxxxx) with actions 
  Copy Link, Share Link, Disable Link (per AGENTS.md Get Paid flow).
- "Request Money" navigates to: Select ZENO user → Enter amount → Add 
  message → Review → Send request → Request sent.
- "QR Code" navigates to the personal ZENO QR code screen (scannable code 
  for others to pay this user).

